$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_A9E8_A69D';
<p>a9e8_a69d</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #6d5d10;">Gene H</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #6d5d10;"><i>horsey</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #6d5d10;">Gene H</span> is quite big and strong-looking, much larger than your typical fruit fly.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #336191;">Gene K</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #336191;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #336191;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8d3b73;">Gene T</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #8d3b73;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8d3b73;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, kidney, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e0ebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1ee; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">191</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e0ebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d3b73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">764</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #336191;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe1ee; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">652</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">horsey</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f5ecb8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">h</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #336191;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8d3b73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,299</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6d5d10;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e0ebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="